  "commission.otherworldinn.description.adventurers_guild_enderman_patrol": "冒险家协会发布巡查委托：清理游荡末影人并回收样本。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.adventurers_guild_nether_suppression": "冒险家协会发布下界清剿委托：击杀烈焰人并顺带清理凋灵骷髅。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.adventurers_guild_raid_breaker": "冒险家协会发布防务委托：击杀袭击者与唤魔者，降低村庄威胁。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.adventurers_guild_warden_hunt": "冒险家协会发布高危委托：前往深暗之域并击杀 1 只监守者。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.builder_decorative_order": "建筑工承接了一栋精装修，需要砖块和玻璃。",
