  "commission.otherworldinn.description.butcher_seafood_order": "屠夫想拓展水产生意，带些鱼过来看看反应。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.farm_animal_feed": "农场需要额外的动物饲料，带些小麦和胡萝卜过来。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.farm_protection": "农场需要加强防护，清理周围的敌对生物。",
