  "commission.otherworldinn.description.farm_supply": "农场的粮食储备不够了，请带一点过来。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.fishing_request": "渔夫正在收购一条指定的鲜鱼。带回委托要求的目标鱼即可完成这份钓鱼委托。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.forge_armor_order": "城镇卫队需要一批新护甲，铁匠需要材料。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.forge_fuel_supply": "铁匠铺的燃料快用完了，需要补充煤炭。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.forge_maintenance": "铁匠铺需要备用金属件，请先送一批材料过来。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.forge_masterpiece": "铁匠要打造一件传世之作，需要最顶级的材料。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.forge_tool_repair": "城外有需要修理的设施，需要材料和帮手。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.forge_weapon_order": "铁匠接到一批武器订单，需要高级金属材料。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.grocer_masonry_supply": "杂货铺收一批石材。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.grocer_shelf_restock": "杂货铺木材见底了，先送一批常用木板过来补货。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.grocer_stone_assortment": "有建筑队要一套杂石样品，帮杂货铺备齐凝灰岩和深板岩石料。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.magic_library_organize": "魔女的图书馆需要整理，顺便收集一些古籍。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.magic_potion_supply": "魔女的药水库存不足了，需要一些基础药材补充。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.magic_ritual_prep": "魔女有一个重要仪式要做，需要极其稀有的材料。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.magic_study_materials": "魔女需要一些稀有的魔法研究材料，帮忙收集一下。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.road_patrol_mixed": "城镇的巡逻队请求支援：沿路清理骷髅并补给食物和工具。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.town_cleanup_spiders": "仓库里出现了蜘蛛，需要清理。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.town_emergency_supplies": "城镇储备应急物资，需要食物和应急用品。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.town_festival_prep": "城镇准备举办庆典，需要食物和装饰材料。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.town_patrol_zombie": "最近城镇外夜间不是很太平，请清理游荡的僵尸。",
  "commission.otherworldinn.description.town_road_repair": "城镇道路需要维修，收集些石材和木材。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.blacksmith.node.ask_goods": "矿石、矿锭、工具都在这，挑你顺手的",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.blacksmith.node.root": "铁火未冷，要打什么？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.blacksmith.node.topic_boiler_room.repaired": "你把它修好了？太好了，我们的机器可以用了",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.blacksmith.node.topic_boiler_room.unrepaired": "地下那座锅炉房好久没人修理了，不知道还能不能用",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.blacksmith.node.topic_boiler_room_location": "在前面右转，穿过集市再右转的小通道里。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.builder.node.ask_goods": "木材、石料、砖瓦——好材料才能盖好房子。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.builder.node.root": "要盖房子？找我准没错！",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.builder.node.small_talk_builder": "可以啊，挑几个蓝图看看喜欢哪个",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.butcher.node.ask_goods": "生肉、皮革、骨头都有，做饭前先来我这儿转转。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.butcher.node.root": "新鲜的肉，刚宰的！要买点什么？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.butcher.node.small_talk_butcher": "牛肉和猪肉最抢手，鸡肉也不差。鱼嘛...偶尔有人买。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.farmer.node.ask_goods": "种子、作物、农具都有，慢慢挑",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.farmer.node.root": "田里刚收了货，想买点啥？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.farmer.node.topic_greenhouse.repaired": "你居然真的把它修好了，感谢你的付出，现在种地更方便了",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.farmer.node.topic_greenhouse.unrepaired": "对面那座温室废弃很久了...以前可好用了",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.fisherman.node.ask_goods": "鱼、水产、还有一些海里的稀罕东西。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.fisherman.node.root": "今天的鱼获不错，来看看？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.fisherman.node.small_talk_fisherman": "有耐心就行。雨天鱼更容易上钩，清晨和傍晚也是好时候。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.grocer.node.ask_goods": "一些乱七八糟的东西，随意看看吧",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.grocer.node.root": "要买什么？我这里什么都有",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_heavy_pack_early.node.root": "明天天不亮就得走，麻烦早点准备早餐。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_heavy_pack_food.node.root": "跑了一整天，先来份热乎的饭再说。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_heavy_pack_repair.node.root": "车轮有点松了，附近有铁匠铺吗？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_heavy_pack_rest.node.root": "肩膀都压麻了，得好好歇一晚。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_heavy_pack_return.node.root": "回程的时候还会路过，记得给我留间房。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_heavy_pack_road.node.root": "前面的路不好走，得养足精神再出发。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_heavy_pack_route.node.root": "我背着这么多货，能有个落脚点真不容易。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_heavy_pack_storage.node.root": "这些箱子先放这儿，别让它们淋雨了。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_heavy_pack_weather.node.root": "看这天色要变，幸好找到地方落脚了。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_bath.node.root": "赶了一天路，能洗个热水澡真是太好了。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_bed.node.root": "这张床看起来挺舒服的，希望被子够暖和。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_checkout.node.root": "明天我就启程，今晚先好好休息。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_fireplace.node.root": "壁炉里的火真暖和，坐在这儿看书应该不错。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_food.node.root": "听说这里的家常菜不错，晚上得尝尝。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_memory.node.root": "这地方让我想起小时候住过的老旅馆。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_morning.node.root": "早上空气真好，适合出去走走。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_rain.node.root": "下雨天待在旅馆里真是明智的选择。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_recommend.node.root": "朋友推荐我来这里的，果然没让我失望。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_return.node.root": "下次路过这里，我还会再来住的。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_weather.node.root": "外面的风好大，幸好旅馆里很安静。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ordinary_welcome.node.root": "这里比我想象中更温暖，今晚应该能睡个好觉。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_rich_business.node.root": "这里的环境适合谈生意，比较安静。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_rich_linen.node.root": "床品的质感还可以，是棉的吗？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_rich_quiet.node.root": "我付了高价就是图个清静，别让我失望。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_rich_referral.node.root": "我会把这里推荐给其他讲究的朋友。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_rich_room.node.root": "房间布置得还算雅致，就是缺个衣帽间。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_rich_service.node.root": "如果服务继续这么周到，我会常来。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_rich_standard.node.root": "以这个价位来说，服务水准还算达标。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_rich_tip.node.root": "照顾得不错，退房时我可能会留点小费。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_rich_view.node.root": "窗外的景色不错，可惜不是海景。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_rich_wine.node.root": "要是晚餐再配点好酒，就更完美了。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_sponsor_appreciation.node.root": "感谢你们保持这里的原汁原味，很难得。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_sponsor_community.node.root": "这里有种家的感觉，旅客们都很友善。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_sponsor_future.node.root": "期待旅馆未来的发展，我会持续关注。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_sponsor_growth.node.root": "看到旅馆越来越好，我很欣慰。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_sponsor_improvement.node.root": "还有什么需要改进的？我可以提供建议。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_sponsor_photo.node.root": "这里氛围真棒，我想拍张照留念。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_sponsor_recommend.node.root": "我会向更多朋友推荐这里，好地方要分享。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_sponsor_renovation.node.root": "旅馆改造后舒服多了，辛苦你们了。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_sponsor_support.node.root": "继续加油，我会一直支持这家旅馆。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_sponsor_tradition.node.root": "老旅馆的味道保留得很好，有情怀。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ultra_rich_discretion.node.root": "我的行程要保密，不要对外透露。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ultra_rich_expectation.node.root": "我习惯的标准很高，希望你们跟得上。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ultra_rich_guard.node.root": "我的行李很贵重，安保别出差错。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ultra_rich_investment.node.root": "这家旅馆有投资潜力，我会关注一下。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ultra_rich_legacy.node.root": "老牌旅馆就是不一样，底蕴深厚。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ultra_rich_perfection.node.root": "细节决定品质，枕头的高度要刚刚好。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ultra_rich_privacy.node.root": "我不喜欢被打扰，安排人手时请注意。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ultra_rich_staff.node.root": "让最经验丰富的员工来服务，新手不要。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ultra_rich_suite.node.root": "这间套房勉强合格，希望夜里足够安静。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_ultra_rich_taste.node.root": "装饰品的品味还可以，是真品吗？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_vip_advanced_order.node.root": "晚些时候我会点餐，记得用最好的食材。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_vip_advanced_reward.node.root": "把事情办漂亮了，回头少不了赏金。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_vip_advanced_security.node.root": "我的随从稍后到，先把房门权限准备好。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_vip_feedback.node.root": "服务流程很规范，我会向上级汇报。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_vip_ordinary_review.node.root": "服务不错，我会给旅馆写个好评。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_vip_ordinary_schedule.node.root": "我的行程很紧，麻烦按时叫醒我。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.guest_vip_ordinary_tea.node.root": "如果能送一壶热茶到房间就更好了。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.magician.node.ask_goods": "材料和书卷都在这，想要什么自己挑",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.magician.node.root": "你面前这么可爱的魔女是谁呢？没错，就是我，你需要什么？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.npc.unknown": "陌生人",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.about_boiler_room": "关于锅炉房",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.about_greenhouse": "关于温室",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.ask_goods": "这里卖什么",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.boiler_room_location": "它在什么位置？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.extra_function": "借用一下铁砧",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.leave": "先告辞",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.open_recycle": "出售物品",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.open_store": "打开商店",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.small_talk_builder": "可以帮忙修建吗",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.small_talk_butcher": "最近什么肉卖得好",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.small_talk_fisherman": "钓鱼有什么诀窍吗",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_collect_thanks": "上次的旅途后来怎样了？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_decline_supplies": "我这里没有，你自己想想办法吧",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_end_intro_helped": "路上小心",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_end_intro_refused": "祝你顺利",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_finish_helped_arc": "我会收好的",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_finish_refused_arc": "欢迎你以后常来",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_hear_story": "后来你还是把地图画完了？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_leave_chatter": "那就等你下次再说",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_leave_final": "下次见",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_leave_intro": "我给你找找，稍后再来",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_leave_return": "改天再细聊",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.option.story_cartographer_offer_supplies": "给你，这些拿去用吧",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.story_cartographer_stage0.node.helped": "帮大忙了。等我把图补完，回旅社时一定亲手谢你。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.story_cartographer_stage0.node.refused": "没事，我总会想办法的。等地图线索多些，我还是会回来坐坐。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.story_cartographer_stage0.node.root": "我在沿海画图，偏偏把记事纸和羽毛笔用光了。你要是愿意借我三张纸和一根羽毛，下次来时我给你看一件好东西。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.story_cartographer_stage1.node.no_help": "最后我把地图也画完了，只是慢了些。说来也怪，路上总觉得要是当时在这儿多坐一会儿，也许会更安心。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.story_cartographer_stage1.node.repaid": "多亏你那几样补给，我没在海雾里把方向丢掉。这只指南针被我调过，送给你，愿它以后总能把人带回这间旅社。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.story_cartographer_stage1.node.root": "我认得这家旅社的灯。上次的海图已经补好了，刚好能来兑现一句承诺。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.story_cartographer_stage2.node.root": "海线会变，旅人的路也会变，但我大概会一直记得这家旅社的灯火。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.story_cartographer_visit_chatter.node.root": "我得趁记忆还热，把刚记下来的风向和潮痕誊到图纸上。等我下次再来，应该能讲给你听一段更像样的见闻。",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.wandering_trader.node.ask_goods": "这次带的都是市面上的新鲜货，想找点什么？",
  "dialogue.otherworldinn.wandering_trader.node.root": "从远方运来的稀奇货物，看看有没有你需要的？",
